  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html",
  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5601.15 Proof of identity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5601.15 \"Proof of identity\" means, for the purposes of RSA 260:14, III, RSA 260:14, IV and 260:14, V(a), a valid drivers license with a photograph if licensed, a valid photo identification card, a passport, a birth certificate, or an identification card issued by a law enforcement agency or place of employment.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
